OL,3,GNEWSAAI helps us spot possible lung
OL,4,Acancer, says medic
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtificial intelligence (AI) is a
OL,7,F"second pair of eyes" helping radiology
OL,8,Fteams identify possible cancer on chest
OL,9,FX-rays, a specialist consultant has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FAt the general hospitals in Kettering
OL,13,Fand Northampton, AI software reviews
OL,14,Fpatients' scans, highlighting subtle
OL,15,Fabnormalities that would be difficult
OL,16,Fto see otherwise.
OL,18,FCornilius Mushambi, consultant
OL,19,Fradiographer, said it "increased
OL,20,Fconfidence" in the final judgement made
OL,21,Fby a clinician, but stressed it did not
OL,22,Freplace human expertise.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
